{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.74]Need to get Max to pull up\n[00:03.82]Folks finna come back and catch this shit\n[00:05.36]Baby, whatcha on? (Whatcha on?)\n[00:10.38]Yeah, yeah (Bitch)\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.84]Check my drip (Yeah), check my steez (Yeah)\n[00:14.52]That's your bitch on her knees (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:16.34]I do whatever I want, yeah (Yeah, uh-huh)\n[00:18.42]I do as I please (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:19.80]Fuck your bitch then I leave (Yeah, uh-huh)\n[00:21.46]On her Gucci purse, I skeet (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[00:22.90]Did I say purse? I meant shirt (Uh-huh, oh)\n[00:24.70]I was aimin' for her teeth (Uh-huh)\n[00:26.24]Young, rich nigga, that's for sure (Uh-huh)\n[00:27.94]All these niggas, in disbelief (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[00:29.56]When I fuck on a freak like Mia Khalif' (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[00:31.08]I'm smoking that tree like Wiz Khalif' (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[00:32.92]Free smoke, my niggas are chimneys (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[00:34.36]Pour a four of the red, the remedy (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[00:36.20]Relapse on meds, I'm in my head (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:37.92]What in the hell's gotten into me? (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:40.48]Uh, lean, pour it up (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:41.82]Take the pill, don't throw it up\n[00:43.22]Uh, yeah, Perc me up (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:44.96]Ain't no such thing as scratchin' enough\n[00:46.68]Uh, yeah, baby girl, I'm sorry (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:49.46]You hate it when I'm high, but I can't help it\n[00:51.06]Uh, ballin' like the Celtics (I was ballin' like the Celtics)\n[00:56.28]Used to sell packs, I smelt it, I dealt it (I used to-, I smelt it, I dealt it)\n[01:00.80]Two-tone skelly AP, it's meltin' (Yeah, gleam, gleam)\n[01:03.76]Fuck your rollie, I could buy that by the dozen (Nigga, fuck your rollie, yeah)\n[01:07.22]Got your bitch heart meltin' (Yeah, got that bih' heart meltin')\n[01:10.34]Had a big heart, now it's meltin' (Yeah, now it's melted)\n[01:13.80]I got a confession, it's embarrassing (It's embarrassing)\n[01:16.62]I ain't know that was yo' bitch that I was nailing (I ain't know that was yo' bitch)\n[01:21.64]My fault, my bad\n[01:24.98]That's a bitch that we damn near all had\n[01:28.32]My fault, my bad, my bad\n[01:32.76]I been in my bag\n[Chorus]\n[01:34.54]That's your bitch on her knees\n[01:36.34]I do whatever I want, yeah\n[01:38.42]I do as I please\n[01:39.54]Fuck your bitch then I leave\n[01:41.24]On her Gucci purse, I skeet\n[01:42.70]Did I say purse? I meant shirt\n[01:44.68]I was aimin' for her teeth\n[01:46.24]Young, rich nigga, yeah, that's for sure (Oh-oh)\n[01:47.96]All these niggas, in disbelief\n[01:49.34]When I fuck on a freak like Mia Khalif' (Oh-oh)\n[01:50.92]I'm smoking that tree like Wiz Khalif'\n[01:52.70]Free smoke, my niggas are chimneys (Oh-oh)\n[01:54.40]Pour a four of the red, the remedy\n[01:56.08]Relapse on meds, I'm in my head (Oh-oh)\n[01:57.92]What in the hell's gotten into me? (I-I)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:00.76]Uh, my fault (My fault), my bad (It's my bad)\n[02:04.18]No good (No good), these bitches all bad (They all bad)\n[02:07.70]I'm high (I'm high), as Hell (As fuck)\n[02:10.78]Three times platinum as well (Three times platinum as well)\n[02:14.14]What's that smell? That's that YSL\n[02:16.56]When I was down bad, I ain't had no help\n[02:18.14]But did that shit right by myself (By myself)\n[02:20.78]What's that smell? Revenge in the air\n[02:23.30]This is for every time I couldn't afford to go get fly, ayy (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:26.64]This is for every time she dissed me for that other guy, ayy (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:30.28]Now she on my line, telling me I'm the love of her life, ayy (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:33.32]Bitch, you not my wife, you really tried, you too trife, ayy (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:36.44]Go and say, \"Hi,\" to that shitty guy, livin' that broke ass life\n[02:40.36]I heard you havin' his kid, I heard you gon' be his bride\n[02:43.60]But when I came through town, you was all up on my line\n[02:46.84]Talkin' 'bout how you fucked up, you should've stayed by my side\n[02:51.02]I can't hear ya' over my whip\n[Chorus]\n[02:53.26]Check my drip, check my steez\n[02:54.54]That's your bitch on her knees (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:56.34]I do whatever I want, yeah (Yeah, uh-huh)\n[02:58.36]I do as I please (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[02:59.78]Fuck your bitch then I leave (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[03:01.46]On her Gucci purse, I skeet (Yeah, uh-huh)\n[03:02.90]Did I say purse? I meant shirt (Uh-huh, oh)\n[03:04.68]I was aimin' for her teeth (Uh-huh)\n[03:06.24]Young, rich nigga, that's for sure (Uh-huh)\n[03:07.96]All these niggas, in disbelief (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[03:10.50]When I fuck on a freak like Mia Khalif' (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[03:13.82]I'm smoking that tree like Wiz Khalif' (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[03:18.56]Free smoke, my niggas are chimneys (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[03:32.70]Pour a four of the red, the remedy (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[03:36.90]Relapse on meds, I'm in my head (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[03:42.52]What in the hell's gotten into me? (Uh-huh, uh-huh)","words":[[0.74,1.02,"Need"],[1.08,1.1,"to"],[1.26,1.38,"get"],[1.52,1.68,"Max"],[1.76,1.82,"to"],[1.9,2.04,"pull"],[3.56,3.78,"up"],[3.82,4.08,"Folks"],[4.12,4.24,"finna"],[4.28,4.44,"come"],[4.48,4.76,"back"],[4.86,4.9,"and"],[4.94,5.02,"catch"],[5.1,5.18,"this"],[5.22,5.32,"shit"],[5.36,5.7,"Baby,"],[6.2,7.88,"whatcha"],[7.96,7.98,"on?"],[9.98,10.24,"(Whatcha"],[10.32,10.34,"on?)"],[10.38,10.44,"Yeah,"],[10.48,10.56,"yeah"],[10.6,10.82,"(Bitch)"],[12.84,12.98,"Check"],[13.04,13.08,"my"],[13.26,13.4,"drip"],[13.44,13.6,"(Yeah),"],[13.66,13.82,"check"],[13.86,14.0,"my"],[14.08,14.3,"steez"],[14.34,14.46,"(Yeah)"],[14.52,14.7,"That's"],[14.76,14.86,"your"],[14.96,15.26,"bitch"],[15.42,15.48,"on"],[15.58,15.7,"her"],[15.76,16.02,"knees"],[16.1,16.18,"(Yeah,"],[16.22,16.3,"yeah)"],[16.34,16.34,"I"],[16.4,16.48,"do"],[16.62,17.12,"whatever"],[17.36,17.36,"I"],[17.46,17.64,"want,"],[17.68,17.8,"yeah"],[17.84,18.04,"(Yeah,"],[18.08,18.24,"uh-huh)"],[18.42,18.42,"I"],[18.5,18.56,"do"],[18.76,18.86,"as"],[18.98,18.98,"I"]